        current operational state of a product within the Engineering
        Node operational workflow. The lifecycle phase identifies where
        the product is in the workflow, while the lifecycle state
        identifies the state of activity within that phase. When
        systems_lifecycle_phase = available and systems_lifecycle_state
        = complete, the product is publicly available
        online.</xs:documentation>
